  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 18 November 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nStep into style and comfort in this beautifully presented, light filled home nestled down a quiet driveway, refurbished and ready to impress! This sparkling gem is the ultimate blend of fresh, contemporary living and everyday convenience, set in the heart of the North Shore’s most coveted school zones.\r\n\r\nWhat You’ll Love:\r\n• Three spacious bedrooms, perfect for growing families or savvy professionals\r\n• Large family bathroom plus two separate toilets (one on each level)\r\n• Open plan, sunlit kitchen, dining, and living area, ideal for entertaining or cozy nights in\r\n• Sleek, modern finishes throughout - just move in and enjoy\r\n• Double garage with internal access plus two off road parking spaces - room for cars, bikes, and maybe even a boat\r\n• Easy-care garden space for kids, gatherings, even a trampoline!\r\n\r\nEducation Excellence:\r\nGive your children the very best start. This home is zoned for top tier schools, including Westlake Girls, Westlake Boys, Takapuna Grammar, Takapuna Intermediate, and Takapuna Primary. Enjoy the peace of mind that comes with access to some of the North Shore’s most sought after education options all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nAdded Peace of Mind:\r\nThis home carries 6 years remaining on its Master Builder Guarantee, offering you security and assurance for years to come.\r\n\r\nOur motivated vendors are serious - this home must be sold! If you’ve been waiting for the right time to seize your North Shore dream, now is your moment. Contact us today to arrange your private viewing and make your move before someone else does.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
